{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 935,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c3f8d8308119f33d75161f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则速度大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "90cd8c947433040f73640edfcf2014847dd7196cb9e1d8c792b702a13bac439e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b077f8552aa4671c56676581",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "力量十分强劲时,速度大幅提升；\\n若是力量十二分强劲\\n速度则超大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afbae9c4f4b65c402c989182cff46555a92903c5e94117ff0110d79fa49d9bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922b9ab1f130d9c34dcd6480",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c20cdd458d0bd8ca97e418e5d1cb15b8250590fbdb9fc7c291f9642e65643c79",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f78098223e2001d687bfeef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度和力量提升\\n若是交流重赏则变为大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0938c1a119052fbd431eb538fac48291e9876050dcd4deecf099decec28ee082",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:182c1fbd2fe5abbab20d5f3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度与力量提升\\n若状态为绝佳,则所有基础能力提升\\n＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec80d54fd9653f8a65c57bde49a238c337752a43cb279d6f3431e261139d4fe5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109802221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fce3d627fc2728e8252eba3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4459c1c1aff511ec15a5215e0fa5473a761f7b52b5e80aafa29b410981d9878",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c4bb0635a7fb86433983bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘进行名次争夺时\\n速度大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec67017c69c04a06e8a5c435fd217ba417ae74194131cc276691b0e574f002e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41779e551595a576e69fe494",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘竞争时速度提升\\n之后最终冲刺时若余力充足\\n则稍微提升加速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "634d30d7760fbc192ae98aeae3dff6db88a8d784eeb2e98cd50af2b0fe6dcf90",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109901221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b720dce09ac08fb93db0e5bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘发动技能时\\n速度大幅提升,之后在比赛终盘\\n发动技能时,加速度稍微提升\\n＜先行・沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "606d88a3446ac8f30b674c166e7a8c932fd189cfe12618561e529715e5ce809c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96081cfc8fcec69cf424dff4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段位于前方时\\n加速度提升,若是1800m以上的\\n比赛,则在初段更早时间内\\n提升加速度＜先行・沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7d61fef11b5ce533b263ef9ad7621922c0254731ff755f02f6f28d977a4b67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "109902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a535ddf78a146375daae1133",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "变得相当不擅长起跑,容易起步晚\\n并且起跑时的加速度也会降低\\n此技能将在育成结束后消失",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e443bfb39ff706a0008206c31cf08885f0f09ab3baf7bf178d9a407c1649932",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1100011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0feac526fd6786f47de44e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed3dfd096a9df9fabea4703bc638000d86eace9fbde6361d3aa02401dd9174a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c1cddbbfa11d2fe91b44d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "准备超越时速度大幅提升\\n并稍微回复耐力＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4fa151e422f983ac974e9b0d405f0d70be0f9e3a4906f54ec2b4126a15fe38a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110001121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2beb47193840eff17d89a9dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "长时间跟随在前方赛马娘身后时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a35fa136592b0551d603ec7f15ee314a3be61fc8453cbc27c24cbcac62dfc0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd12b6425900c174bd7393c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺阶段超越或竞争时\n大幅向前突进<泥地>",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea90eac09fc5ebc4ab1793f192223284b888dd6faf3d9474bc1a9fd17692456",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a01b92dcc6e1b021b34fbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\n泥地比赛且根性极为充足时\n则极大提升<先行/居中>",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ee74b11523c6112d9989328c85d5e5416dd577c5c24ba10f36efa53d7c1968",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29abb519addf395a7ffabf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时如果使用了两次技能\\n且位于队伍中间时\\n回复体力并少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc200b22fa00d9e5350b7bdc5f32261868a1700bb9154620941f8c1bf98b9325",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3964ed2af4f71b3c99669d25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘处于领头位置时稍微向前突进\\n若此时为第三弯道并且中盘拉开巨大差距\\n领先时,迅速向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17b92678e34f5cc46087f26f5374a1cbbb3babe3e4dffe91fa359fdb0a7b069",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1570d332fda317537d86f8f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后位于前列穷追不舍时\\n会在最终直线展现不屈的斗志\\n大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef38bf2b2673a725bdf6348e85f25bf528df20de51bc4ca08212049af4f4745",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa513909f7f3e48791426a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半位于前方时\\n如果通过技能回复了持久力\\nLET’S,GO！速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e1aefdec2afc962bfb5ce563cbb3b1d4a1d52524e9f47bcc07c4119e3d0ccc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617ff5142bf217502c6c2512",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后,在先头集团突围时\\n展现闪耀般的华丽动作\\n短时间速度大幅加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c6c66ab87183f1bbb06c697e29545a1fc27991418ee7774515e79cadfee6eed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e46496b181a5e5e6ab9144",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用技能恢复3次以上的持久力后\\n会在比赛后半部分调整呼吸\\n奋力向胜利迈进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfb478bad96fd694887fa1b99bf7cd4133c82661a9a2f3d40c5d18848261cb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fef225c3b1e3082042a2693",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的某个地方少量提升速度\\n并且无视条件\\n发动两个用得上的金技能",
      "source_fingerprint": "4864c00941e41aabe09fbb56aed4cc7a0f89d99c160899e39e5239f0e0d63c0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:901ffe314e84ccb57752d57d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入中盘之后在下坡时位于中间集团\\n则下完坡后在短时间内速度提升\\n如果位于东京竞马场则再次推高档位",
      "source_fingerprint": "5823c187b971ffcb07c406479e8792360f2cf85aeb290bb32833e343ebe6cc92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7508ccf69dbecc5287a44afe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的直线位于前方时速度少量持续上升\\n位于领头位置并与后方马娘距离较近时\\n技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "966bcae7e012344ff8ed66040305492f29f0872a74889200c403ec1b405526c5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ebdd9f74860934bee0f3ce0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余200m处位于队伍前方时提高速度\\n若此时前方较近处有赛马娘时\\n会以强有力的奔跑向前冲刺",
      "source_fingerprint": "67a920aba4d2e37736da08e7d46a52f0a5b712fdb9a83ce2485f8c1774bf8367",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c08bb3d0d4dae426f8998fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于后方且名次下降时\\n以温柔的治愈之光回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f106c184e3ae3900bb21a4dbe925cc9dbde3beb9811e6e80479233ea41bc65ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded8320753a44b1c3a2cd5e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成三次追赶,在临近终盘的下坡路\\n位于后方时,短时间内速度提升\\n并略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a2cd2db2ab70fff25e7fee70ba77db4b866d940913ead9ab896dc4f267cc51d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e2b906eb851e11e510f08b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘最终弯道处于前方时被超越时\\n速度持续上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f78c3ae6e366493e67cbf26e8374b20c2a7c0a37d4b80144d36a024e94c39541",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290e8a9a5c0cf00e11563a37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后弯道由中部梯队开始向前冲击时\\n燃烧斗魂提升加速力",
      "source_fingerprint": "49173278e6ae89c465e7f166dcd513b0e3a03378f2ac3b6fb6fd18b6e6e1e6e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d780dca246221140a6d908d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "距终点400米的位置身处前方时速度提升\\n若是比赛中合计使用过7次技能\\n变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "843e93c7d48b305c04debefe701de32cc5d95fd7bfe1ca92203afda43e8bc1df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c70bba0f53947cd3f36ea3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的最终弯道后半处位于前列时\\n速度提升,若是长距离比赛且中盘进行\\n过位置竞争,速度迅猛提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b12e30396bb9746e46d9b29f6658c98ffba7a0c71a3ca5b44d7199e55e67d17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e721a3cc629465da55670574",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘身处前方并有被反超的危险时\\n会在最终弯道前燃烧斗魂\\n使速度持续上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d98071c362adf46a1c69d99611fc745df1d68a9b7c1cfcb7e929653ec27fc960",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3589f1eda0f8ca4a0692a298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程中盘于前方开始进行发力时\\n提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f82435c04e6023bf9eb6202467bdb4a3d053f511e866465b72e179d583d9818",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9dd965857f8f0e9634046d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘的弯道位于中间集团往后的位置\\n且附近有3名及以上的马娘酱时\\n因萌之力量而提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56cbb73a99415dd0369a9e1a12f3870e9a74e07db931262846d2828477aa73f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1967cae58389e72c5ae835",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的直线身处前方时,会得意洋洋地\\n提升速度。若这恰巧也是看台对面跑道时\\n还会一并稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acde25713721f99eb514445df151b3a1f79d7dd6cbf3e628dfbcf6d9ceb6f7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e184611f6efb1326ba5773",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入中盘的直线时回复体力\\n并稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a5f8144dc6cb3ee584aa47ca2bc14736ea786c7b611013dc19a7b32041ded9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d955b43353d4a0f0e6b2c0c0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时位于中间往后位置\\n则令前后各3名赛马娘的速度稍微下降\\n并大幅提高自己的速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b0ba47f9bd3d4bedaab43ef5d0e682de55dbe0d9f30fc61410c6a614d78746",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2625e6ee096a28e7213fa0ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时消耗耐力\\n一段时间内速度提升＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "860130003fcc5821b2a6d5bf80ee730b721fcd3aeccb9c1ec76f9df04cfb2606",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110201221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86c478449261dead63041798",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中技能发动13次后\n向前突进，且包含自身在内的队伍\n成员略微向前突进<中距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "29ae21476571643db8fb03c3d817aaf2cdf4b39fb3e1e5a05dfcef458488f6a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d72bdfb42ea208fa1f063b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段向前突进\n此外中距离比赛中技能发动时若位于\n前方，则包含自身在内的队伍成员\n略微向前突进<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "b608732485c006f01b1b533705941a273e786a34e97aef5f78b559e4809eacbc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48750a573e88015eb99f8567",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘发动两次技能时\\n速度少量持续上升,若在效果持续中继续发动技能\\n会提升效果速度量,最大两次",
      "source_fingerprint": "697b1e1146583fef7575a4f78af107901e1bc970d8e42a58c07e32ba8ba77cca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f71b27b3a234d67a30662f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘最终弯道往后处于好位置时\\n提升速度。若距离终点尚远\\n则会展现出绝佳状态额外提升少量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "432b4a6e2ab7e91bcd1db03c7383ed07ce595bc11bea23eaaae8c1dc12a205f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303112a046d8626919ec4f86",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从起跑到比赛后半为止\\n持续保持好位置的话,就会在比赛中盘\\n找到通往胜利的道路,提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6043d1ea3fb8f82043267b0b65c5c7f4e9b452d4a2627ac43eb248b47dd85a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9efe2f779a0706fd882826",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前\\n在前方完成超越时提升速度\\n在后方完成超越时则提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "c12beb81cf9f7f71c68ecdf044a58f76078c6ca23240a72218af4255c8813a14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3a7e78ad6750926aee51b89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段若一直位于队伍中后方\\n则在比赛终盘的最终弯道\\n以及往后向前小幅突进\\n如果是长距离比赛则增加效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "b83b639df1c4693f328a229dac0999cab0733e5f8ca875f873965d0253f1fc69",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e5d0bbf14ebafd97f8e916",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘弯道位于前方集团时\\n若检测到后方有其他马娘的话\\n将稍微调整呼吸,加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a330e4116809e07bead728fb8f34eedc833de7c53b40ed053fe028e5360d41a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:318b4653339a80ac054d8e14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的下坡处在第二名开外距离领头4马身\\n以内时,短时间内速度提升\\n中距离比赛则额外略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "020d565901e51b8459a575e6e7a5cdd0d16509af7f8da1ceecfd129bdcfb8dc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03fc87435ebefe0cb45bb1c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘的某一刻处于优势位置时\\n会在短时间内提升速度\\n在短距离或英里比赛中则会在短时间内\\n大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7176e9cdbd13b1e12363588c9cb291d90320d958a0947895e472a26d1d25a27c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fdbcfd091f2ca4ceae9b895",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近在前方开始加速时\\n短时间内提升速度,若是英里比赛\\n则增加速度量",
      "source_fingerprint": "73333d1ded2c3ccfbc61f0bff832e54d80df7472ffeba47818088865ae4076cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09492e650ee3402145ae9a74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘身处好位置时\\n会吸取前方赛马娘的持久力\\n并且小幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c26e06223d9505e43260341ec3007445e642d0e060b26eb18c76ee2353372c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70763c2a36d9fdb6ba39c3ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段的弯道进行左右\n移动时稍微提升加速度\n且略微向前突进<先行·中距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ae46f71b2cfc22148bad115ea737272e72ca4ffe7019f29933c90c5d4d96f1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91cd9684dc0c58d75e934262",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在上坡速度大幅提升\n<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c4166285841bf7a661c41fb7cda68edea6ad6f35745750f4a7d6868b8399372",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed339010bd82d32181491b2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方竞争时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ed0fc5ce73af631243ac69a835407a9af3711646292d2eeb9d6b24bb257b57a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "11031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:091a72097b70207a5854e095",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘开头位于前方时\\n速度少量持续上升\\n并少量回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2533d2eb65c60bb9a3ebd126160e71b38f2de08b106636b3f203c188506361",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8394406539d180e035d836af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半的弯道位于好位置时,短时间\\n内速度大幅提升,若是中山竞马场\\n则根据自身速度同时提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "076b8b5195cd4e66d10c3419b16a28866a5047b1f02f967acafa88a59bd60b9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ce316f5192ec983d4d149f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后一个弯道之后,如果处于中团或更后方\\n加速度会提升,如果是,2400,米的比赛\\n则会大幅度提升＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e337a522010c43ed3ee6efe7014c138eaaafa27da97a28cd896b900d3e16916b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ea29546a35d423d8f553d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的弯道处从后方逼近对手时\\n到最终直线会提升速度\\n并根据终盘弯道处超过对手次数提升效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "910ce2ec162de010e13970c806927e6e96c718213e7655ec62e1a0bc34e8b222",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c7b6153e448a613e4cce525",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线进行最后冲刺时位于中间集团往后\\n则速度逐渐少量提升,效果持续中\\n每发动一次技能提高一次速度,最大3次",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bbe31dbbd3cfbf112f8cfeafd0304f7cf9c80d9fed6696cd67578bfdcd07f67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:206bfbd1c2c5d7430d025f3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半之后,进行赶超时速度提升\\n如果比赛中盘在中间位置被人超越过\\n则变为速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea3aed636c8ba95089b073477ce229abbeecf77336957bf7b319ae0b18d48e0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d65aa3ec69272fabc50f514",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后完成2次超越的话\\n将把荣耀化作力量\\n在最终直线持续提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "793d1efdcc27465604a19053ec87af15cf39fedf4075eb044563d4093feb248f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa19abcc3d8cd578f6248c7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余350m处于前方\\n与后方马娘距离接近时\\n以绝不退让的意志更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f03bdfa5ff7c6e91bf29e5ef07bbd989c3fcc4ea69c55ebc749f131d8fb9248",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b223d9e8eeeef39a5b3d6e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘之后的上坡处位于队伍中间时\\n上完坡后优雅地展现怪力\\n提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d2578e449a908b7eb72b50e86518a054bd2541d180d733dc620ff5b77e25062",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d4b8b8e751b867857ce6ee0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后弯道若是位于中间梯队并进行名次争夺\\n则比较容易超越并摆脱纠缠",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a237c20ad917fb23d29e54ce70550a894bb3177e78b33ef9b4be3f7708d2fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777bf2c8cad4e3a6c86efdfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时加速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eef3f148c31dbd9d0bb9c58d8bbad55cd4af12eaf11cd410dde6d6917e0f148",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d04cc0b45085b57d903453",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘拉开巨大差距领先并且到最终直线\\n依然保持领先时速度极大提升,若为东京竞马场\\n中距离比赛则增加技能效果＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db1e8b8a60b7c0e8dbe4a02d256f69efb660701b32ef08dbfc2f9623eaf21bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf3c3ebecf309720fe263bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道处位于前三名时\\n加速度提升并向前突进＜领放・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6404e64e424eae5a1f6c7a9f05cfa18b91eb7b0b2f2ec38cd22d25f8c4495a43",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f514367acf8a2223b249c323",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之前的第三弯道\\n位于前方时,大幅向前突进＜领放・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ca0d58e7153e74d8d9f86a767415369ac8ddeedcf3a2529d440606228ec6f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830788f429d03113d3954447",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余400m处位于前三名,则短时间内\\n略微提升加速度,在中盘竞争持续时间越长\\n则技能效果越好\\n技能持续时间越长",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7fa56b43682a93548f40213a14cd13703e8f1761973229950b8c4d87359e9b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029cbf8158bfcea7db76a986",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段在前方准备超越时\\n小幅向前突进,若是短距离或者英里比赛\\n则之后在最终弯道完成超越时速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2767084aea3ecb34383725649c5b39b1ce743ce5a0a92fb4a89842dfa0b5986d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc523e177ef6d12fa3e76fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘以后的下坡位于后方时\\n稍微消耗体力短时间内向前突进\\n之后若干劲为好调或绝好调\\n则在终盘的最终直线短时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "52818d3014b15cf255a0d486f7e352f32d6388a58bc7c69ce11522fd1934e331",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:563d0fd98a001150b7ff0391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线处于好位置\\n且和前方马娘距离很近的话\\n更容易完成超越",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ffdb4d231c2e687389f3ab7329af94a5af992ee2ccb3227f9d67dfe8ad8169b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0e05d65a2f6a710d1c13d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段位于领头附近时\\n速度逐渐少量提升,在沙土比赛中\\n额外回复少量持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f34dcfe263ea7e4b1f668de2ac0f8e32a8873dc7d90b470820c9255ab2ec33c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b83e7b857767b9d076a49ffc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,若是东京竞马场的中距离比赛或者中山竞马场的2500m比赛\\n则额外向前小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fedfa2eee98186b200b9f6b477483b2562088bd9345cd1497650e9e9c92a09c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94d73f94d10ef705d38e12bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段前后位于队伍中间时\\n速度少量持续上升\\n如果心情绝好调则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d2280adc2354c53889943ac27bc48435f817b81f2b245e8a70faf7e5456534e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3549700886695fab1cd1f265",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘初期的某处降低速度，\n此后在终盘迫近的某处若位于中团\n则持续略微提升速度，若距离领头较远\n则持续大幅提升<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "1be24c0523e3d2c199eacf16231dd0e2800f8032b2ca35a843ff99544eeacad2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a1c79898441e6a4bb3c79b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的最终弯道后半\\n向着顶点进发,从中间集团开始提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0075f68d5a6eb47c036181af5d9a193c53af6854b476887cf93bc55780f30f8a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2dbab12a49b712008d3532c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n则大幅提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7191db74dbd35c482a42fc78eba416212aac7b00f44120917e364fe02db0ee2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7512bfe14934463ed75b9c10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中若触发了13次技能\\n则短时间内向前突进＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "65abf98b677d88bca63a51136effe27e641722bfea936ce1183b430fd651f918",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "110501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065c2a96c60c9a6d3e07206f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中发动了13次技能,则向前突进\\n并使包含自身的队伍成员\\n速度稍微提升＜中距离＞",
